    "chosen_approach": "CLARIFICATION_GATED_STRUCTURED_LLM_PROTECTED_ROUTING",
    "key_tradeoff": "one additional bounded Groq call on protected proposals in exchange for a semantic safety boundary before protected resource and pending-action state",
    "problem_solved": "the frozen R3 local classifiers could not jointly meet protected recall, protected FPR, and unsupported recall, and the stop rule forbids another classifier cycle",
    "reversibility": "HIGH",
    "why_it_suits_sentinelvoice": "it reuses Groq-first tool calling and the deterministic authorization stack inside the modular monolith, adding only a bounded check at the measured protected-action boundary"
  },
