      "resolution_rule": "if non-fresh development validation shows truncation, change the budget only through a separately frozen amendment before fresh evaluation begins"
    },
    {
      "description": "the existing Groq provider sends tool_choice auto, so the model may answer in text; this is a zero-call verifier failure and fails closed",
